// Sofa Circuit — family house ground floor (art bible §3.3): cosy and lived-in; warm afternoon
// window light through the south patio windows, cool shadows; lamps at night.
(
    name: "House",
    indoor: true,
    shadow_distance: 100.0,
    room: Some((
        height: 11.5,
        windows: [
            (wall: South, center: 0.3, width: 22.0, height: 8.0, sill: 1.0),
            (wall: South, center: 0.7, width: 22.0, height: 8.0, sill: 1.0),
